      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Yeah, what this guy means is making it so that you can simply disable gesture overrides on oculus, I personally think this should be a thing on all controller types, and skeletal input be used for the finger positions (or hell, I don't even care how the finger positions are done, they can be disabled with the gestures for all I care on controllers without individual finger tracking...)",
