      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "If you change your controls in SteamVR, you can do this with Windows Mixed Reality headsets (and I'd guess Vive as well, but I'm not sure). I seems strange to me that this isn't already an optional binding for Oculus as well.",
      "viewerReactions": null
